The mempool database migrates automatically to schema 9 on first writable open, adding an `arrival_seq` column and two indexes and dropping `by_fee_rate`; older binaries, including `stacks-inspect`, cannot open a migrated mempool and panic with `Unknown schema version 9`, so to downgrade, stop the node and delete `chainstate/mempool.sqlite` (it is recreated empty and refilled from peers).
